      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "いいだろう。\r\nでは、黒焦げにするのはやめて、腕試しに変えてやろう。",
        "official_en": "Very well. I shall withhold punishment. Instead, let there be a test of skill.",
        "real_en": "Very well. I'll spare you being burned to a crisp and make it a test of strength instead."
      },
