        "official_en_sha256": "08091c951554f2938f1ca945a9c2aaf69c5b9fed0a322acedc78a2f11cb23720"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ならば、そいつを連れてこい。\r\n黒焦げにしてやる。",
        "official_en": "Then, bring this...Lazarov to me. I shall burn the human to ashes.",
        "real_en": "Then bring him here. I'll burn him to a crisp."
